<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cox Radio upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cox Radio upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it had upgraded its rating for Cox Radio Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 16-3/4 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
